{"name":"Purple Funk","hex":"#747582","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"purple","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A colour between red and blue; violet, though often closer to magenta.","Any non-spectral colour on the line of purples on a colour chromaticity diagram or a colour wheel between violet and red."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a purple hue.","Not predominantly red or blue, but having a mixture of Democrat and Republican support."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/purple"},{"term":"funk","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Foul or unpleasant smell, especially body odor.","A style of music derived from 1960s soul music, with elements of rock and other styles, characterized by a prominent bass guitar, dance-friendly sound, a strong emphasis on the downbeat, and much syncopation."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To emit an offensive smell; to stink.","To envelop with an offensive smell or smoke."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/funk"}],"entries":[{"title":"Purple Funk","blocks":[{"text":"\"Purple Funk\" is a 2017 song by Mothers Favorite Child featuring singer CeCe Peniston, released as a music download, as well on CD single, distributed through the band's own label MFC in association with Reel People Music on June 22, 2017."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e8/Purple_Funk_single.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purple_Funk","wikidata":"Q108485763"},{"title":"Funk","blocks":[{"text":"Funk is a music genre that originated in African-American communities in the mid-1960s when musicians created a rhythmic, danceable new form of music through a mixture of various music genres that were popular among African-Americans in the mid-20th century. It deemphasizes melody and chord progressions and focuses on a strong rhythmic groove of a bassline played by an electric bassist and a drum part played by a percussionist, often at slower tempos than other popular music. Funk typically consists of a complex percussive groove with rhythm instruments playing interlocking grooves that create a \"hypnotic\" and \"danceable\" feel. Early funk, specifically James Brown, fused jazz and blues, and added a syncopated drum groove."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/James_brown-09.jpg/330px-James_brown-09.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Funk","wikidata":"Q164444"},{"title":"Purple","blocks":[{"text":"Purple is a color similar in appearance to violet light. In the RYB color model historically used in the arts, purple is a secondary color created by combining red and blue pigments. In the CMYK color model used in modern printing, purple is made by combining magenta pigment with cyan pigment, black pigment, or both. In the RGB color model used in computer and television screens, purple is created by mixing red and blue light in order to create colors that appear similar to violet light. According to color theory, purple is considered a cool color."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Iris_sanguinea_cultivar%2C_Wakehurst_Place%2C_UK_-_Diliff.jpg/330px-Iris_sanguinea_cultivar%2C_Wakehurst_Place%2C_UK_-_Diliff.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purple","wikidata":"Q3257809"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Chaka_Kahn_during_inaugural_activities_on_the_National_Mall_in_Washington%2C_D.C._on_January_20%2C_1997.jpg/500px-Chaka_Kahn_during_inaugural_activities_on_the_National_Mall_in_Washington%2C_D.C._on_January_20%2C_1997.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Chaka_Kahn_during_inaugural_activities_on_the_National_Mall_in_Washington%2C_D.C._on_January_20%2C_1997.jpg/500px-Chaka_Kahn_during_inaugural_activities_on_the_National_Mall_in_Washington%2C_D.C._on_January_20%2C_1997.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AChaka_Kahn_during_inaugural_activities_on_the_National_Mall_in_Washington%2C_D.C._on_January_20%2C_1997.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Sly_and_the_Family_Stone_on_Soul_Train.jpg/500px-Sly_and_the_Family_Stone_on_Soul_Train.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Sly_and_the_Family_Stone_on_Soul_Train.jpg/500px-Sly_and_the_Family_Stone_on_Soul_Train.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASly_and_the_Family_Stone_on_Soul_Train.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/GeorgeClinton.jpg/500px-GeorgeClinton.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/GeorgeClinton.jpg/1280px-GeorgeClinton.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/GeorgeClinton.jpg/500px-GeorgeClinton.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGeorgeClinton.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Anitta_for_Spotify.jpg/500px-Anitta_for_Spotify.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Anitta_for_Spotify.jpg/500px-Anitta_for_Spotify.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wi